  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information and Counselling for Voluntary Return</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to provide support to migrants to return voluntarily to their countries of origin. To achieve this, the proposed project aims to provide up to 400 third country nationals (TCNs) in Bulgaria with information on possibilities for voluntary return and reintegration. Target beneficiaries are TCNs, including undocumented migrants, applicants for international protection, applicants for international protection that have their application rejected as well as beneficiaries for international protection.</narrative>
  </description>
